<title>MOROCCO: Morocco wholesale prices unchanged in October.</title>
<headline>Morocco wholesale prices unchanged in October.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's October Wholesale Price Index (WPI) was unchanged from September at 356.2 points, the Statistics Directorate said in its latest bulletin on Monday.</p>
<p>    MOROCCO WHOLESALE PRICES     Oct 96   Sept 96</p>
<p>    Index				 356.2   356.2</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (percent)	unch     -0.9</p>
<p>Note - Wholesale prices in January-October were up 5.2 percent from the same 1995 period. The Directorate said farm product prices fell 0.6 percent and industrial prices rose 0.4 percent in October.</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
